==============================================================================
NOTE ON src/lib/fairdraw/
==============================================================================

The files in src/lib/fairdraw/ are a TypeScript port of the draw and entry
code published by FairDraw in its guide "Getting to a 10"
(https://fairdraw.partyofone.quest/guides/getting-to-10.html). That code is
itself MIT licensed by the same author
(https://fairdraw.partyofone.quest/about.html#code). Keep the credit comments
at the top of those files.
